# Distilled

Sam describes Distilled as providing provider client libraries that return Effects with named error types.
These include errors that provider specifications do not document. [Effect Office Hours 27, 55:19](https://youtu.be/fPSxB7ZgSJw?t=3319) [56:35](https://youtu.be/fPSxB7ZgSJw?t=3395).

See [Effect Office Hours 27](/lore/effect-office-hours-27-alchemy-infrastructure-as-effects).
